  </div>

  <div class="guidelines-content" id="guidelinesContent" style="display: none;">
    <div class="guidelines-section">
      <h5 class="section-title">
        <span class="section-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="#2e7d32" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
            <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
            <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
            <line x1="10" y1="9" x2="8" y2="9"></line>
          </svg>
        </span>
        Request Approvals
      </h5>
      <ul class="guidelines-list">
        <li>All requests must be submitted at least <strong>three (3) to five (5) working days</strong> prior to the required date.</li>
        <li>This lead time allows sufficient review, revisions, and endorsement.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="guidelines-section">
        <h5 class="section-title">
          <span class="section-icon">
            <svg width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="#2e7d32" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M22.7 19.3l-6-6a7 7 0 1 1 2.1-2.1l6 6a1.5 1.5 0 1 1-2.1 2.1zM8 12a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8z"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
          Service Requests
        </h5>
      <ul class="guidelines-list">
        <li>All service requests must be submitted at least <strong>seven (7) to ten (10) working days</strong> prior to the required date.</li>
        <li>This gives the team ample time to assess the request, assign resources, and schedule accordingly.</li>
        <li>Requests involving large-scale projects or specialized requirements may require a longer lead time with a minimum of <strong>fourteen (14) working days</strong>, subject to assessment by the concerned unit/s and is case-to-case basis.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

      <!-- Recent Activity Section -->
